Subject: [PATCH 39/66] =?UTF-8?q?Glint:=20web-UI=20sidebar=20architecture?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E2=80=94=20the=20Glint=20UI=20extension=20side=20panel=20IS?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20the=20sidebar?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- No native tab strip (GetTabStripType -> kNone); layout styling, frame-gray
  continuity and rounded content card (12px, equal 10px margins) preserved
  under the new mode; content shadow box disabled (panel is permanent chrome)
- Chromeless side panel: no header/border/card corners, slim resize gutter,
  180px min width, auto-opens for the Glint UI extension per window
- Frame + side-panel colors pinned to the Glint gray in the color mixer
- Toolbar: sidebar toggle button, hidden pinned actions, 14px icons, empty
  strip drags the window (incl. the omnibox-slot spacer), close-side-panel
  affordance suppressed
- A normal window survives its last tab closing (blank workspace state)
